WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
<b>Yena's Family Home</b>

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:05.520
Yena, how has school been since 
you started living as a girl?

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:07.360
<b>All students of Seton
Academy live in a dorm,
but many return home
 on weekends</b>

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.360
Have you had any trouble?

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.790
Nothing's changed, really.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.450
I just feel a little awkward 
using the women's hot spring.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.280
Really? Glad to hear it.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.530
You're still the same Yena, after all.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.200
Exactly.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.220
Huh?

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:22.410
Even if you don't act like a female, 
it's best to just be yourself.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:23.970
That's right!

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.090
<i>Not like... a female?</i>

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.710
<i>What's it mean to be "like a female"?!</i>

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.990
<i>I tried fighting like a female,</i>

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.850
<i>but I feel like there's something 
fundamentally off about this...</i>

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:52.070
<b>Female</b>

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:52.070
<b>Fighter's Brain</b>

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:55.970
<i>If I'm going to be a female, I want 
to be a female among females!</i>

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.950
<i>But what am I supposed to 
do to seem more female?</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>I wish there was some model 
female that I could imitate.</i>

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Yena-chan...

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.290
You can use this if you want.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:19.470
<b>Female</b>

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.100
<b>Female</b>

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.350
<b>Female</b>

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:24.040
S-So female...

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:25.100
What's wrong?

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.980
You're so female!

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:41.970
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:41.970
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:03.600
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:13.610
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:01.070
<b>Seton Academy Record 7      The Wild Habits of a Troubled Animal</b>

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.580
<b>Stare</b>

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:07.700
Jin!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.050
Hey!

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.460
Jin!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.960
<i>So cute!</i>

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:18.250
Look, Kuromori! That cute little 
thing is my baby sister!

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:17.400
Jin! Jin! Jin!

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.660
Get off of me!

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.660
I am aware.

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:21.370
You're still not going to talk to her?

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:22.440
You fool!

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.820
If she finds out I'm here, 
she'll tell me to go home again!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:27.930
I want to keep watching her forever and ever!

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.930
Oh, my sister's here again.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.100
Besides, Ranka's—

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:30.100
Hey!

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:33.740
Please let me join your pack!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.150
You again?

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:38.610
Yes! I'm Anamitsu Tel, the one
 you saved that one time!

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:45.280
Hmph. You sure are tough for picking 
on small animals, you scum.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.120
Hey, you all right, shrimp?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.630
You're unhurt?

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:49.830
Yes!

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:53.620
I want to be strong like you were back then!

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.700
So please let me join your pack!

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:58.380
I'll be useful to you, so please let me join!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.130
Please! Please!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.550
I see I've become a weirdo magnet...

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.180
Listen, kid. We're a wolf pack.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.920
If you're not a wolf...

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.250
Then what about her?

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:09.530
Her? Um...

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:10.650
What is she doing?

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.690
That guy's wearing a female's uniform?!

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:15.980
Hey!

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.380
Are you in the boss's pack, too?

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:21.860
Huh? No, I'm not in any pack.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.450
Then why are you here?

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.620
I've been observing a female.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.570
Female?

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:28.300
You mean that wolf?

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:28.300
Good morning, you two.

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:29.730
Oh, Hitomi!

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:31.870
No, I'm observing that human female.

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:30.530
Morning.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:31.870
What're you reading?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.930
It's a book I just bought the other day.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:35.130
I want to learn what it means 
to be like a female from her.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.130
Oh, really?

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.130
Oh...

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.700
Like a female?

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:39.860
I don't get it.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:42.380
She was so insistent that 
she was a male before...

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.760
How things change.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:47.020
I made up my mind that I'll 
be the most female among females!

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.430
Like a real man!

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.990
I see! Good luck!

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:51.900
Thanks!

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.500
Wait, who are you?

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.620
The newest member of the 
boss's pack, Anamitsu Tel!

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:58.050
You're not a member of my pack.

00:04:58.050 --> 00:04:59.180
Aw...

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:00.820
Why not just let her join?

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.170
What have you got to lose?

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:02.690
No!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:05.170
The only female in our pack is the boss.

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:08.040
It's a rule that we don't 
let other females join.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:09.990
Why can't females join?!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.120
The only little sister I need is Ranka!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.950
Oh! That means...

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:20.000
If I defeat this Ranka person, 
I can be your little sister!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:20.980
Huh?

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:23.630
Wrong! And don't do that!

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.560
I'll do my best to beat her!

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:26.340
Hey! Stop!

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.430
Ooh! Whee!

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:33.510
What the heck is her deal?!

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:36.290
Well, you guys just do your 
best at what you gotta do.

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.310
Right...

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:56.500
<b>Cafeteria</b>

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.250
Time to eat.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:10.050
Right.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:10.890
Uh...

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:22.800
How was that?

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.480
Huh? Um, I...

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.360
Did I seem... like a female?

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:31.440
Um... You seemed like you, 
Yena-chan. It was cute.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:32.370
It didn't work?!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:35.950
I'm doing the same thing as 
you! How is it different?!

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.860
Why are you trying to imitate me, anyway?

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:42.220
Because I made up my mind to be a female,

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:45.000
and as I see it, you're the ideal female.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.810
I want to be the kind of female who 
reeks of femininity, like you!

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:50.980
That was meant as a compliment, right?

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:54.220
If you're having trouble, why don't you 
talk to the other cooking club members?

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.220
I can't be that pathetic!

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:59.220
I really think you should 
talk to other people, too.

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.630
There are some things 
I don't understand myself.

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:02.480
Ugh...

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.480
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.480
I guess I'll have to.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:08.300
So we were hoping all of you could help her out.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:09.500
I see.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.580
You look nice in the female uniform, Yena-san.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.760
Why are you hanging around Hino-san, again?

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:19.160
I made up my mind to live as a female,

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:22.050
Hey, what's this girl like?

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:23.380
but I didn't know how, 
and then I saw her and decided

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.380
Well...

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.040
that I would follow her example!

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:29.630
What?! She's female, but she has a d*ck?!

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:33.690
It's true! She really does have a d*ck!

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:37.100
I-It's not on public display!

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:41.980
So basically, you're saying 
you want to be like Hino-san?

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:42.990
Exactly!

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:45.300
She's the most feminine student at this school.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:46.060
Not happening.

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.690
Huh?! Why not?!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:52.340
You're a male! What do you know?!

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:52.990
Okay, so try imitating Hino-san, then.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.570
But I already have been.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:58.910
What?! Hino-san doesn't speak 
in such a vulgar tone!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:07:59.910
Your eyes look mean!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.300
You're sloppy!

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:02.370
Your uniform's dirty!

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:05.340
You fall short of Hino-san in every way!

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:09.940
Why do you know so much about Hitomi, anyway?!

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:11.280
Are you a stalker?!

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.130
Wha... You... N-No! It's not like that!

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:15.170
I know!

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:19.220
Why doesn't Hitomi-san try 
imitating Yena-san instead?

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:19.810
Huh?

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:22.470
Sounds fun!

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:24.090
We'll mess up her uniform a bit!

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:25.810
Spread your legs more!

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.780
And make a scary face!

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:35.570
Y-You wanna fight, punk?

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:39.260
Do I look that sexy to everyone else?

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:41.910
Not at all. Not even remotely. Just give it up.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:42.940
Excuse me?!

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:45.590
You know there's no way 
you'll ever be like that.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.290
I <i>will</i> be like that!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.850
If I really get serious, I can be just as...

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.460
Just as...

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.580
That's what happens?

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.650
Hello!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.210
Who are you?

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:03.350
I'm Anamitsu Tel! I'm a honey badger!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:06.300
Ranka-san! Please fight me!

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:07.740
What? Why?

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.860
Please! Fight me!

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.250
No way!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.700
Why should I do that?

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.240
I'm gonna defeat you and—

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.120
We're busy. Come back later.

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.250
What was that girl's deal?

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.040
No idea...

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:26.230
There you are!

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:29.810
Hey! Don't try to do anything 
stupid like fighting Ranka-san!

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:31.890
If you even try to do that...

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:33.030
<i>The honeyguide.</i>

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:36.220
<i>A bird that primarily feeds upon 
honeybee larvae and hives.</i>

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:39.000
<i>The honey badger, also known 
as the ratel, loves honey,</i>

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.600
<i>so it shares a symbiotic relationship 
with the honeyguide,</i>

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:46.350
<i>as it leads them to sources of honey 
that they can't find on their own.</i>

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:46.350
This is the best honey I've ever had!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:47.910
Whee!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.470
Of course, if I can't stop 
you, I'll also be—

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.060
Hey! Wait!

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:52.570
Give it a rest already!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:58.320
Don't think for a second that a beast 
like you can imitate Hino-san!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.260
Shut your mouth! I'm gonna do it!

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:02.830
A man never goes back on his word!

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:06.840
Here. Your ribbon's crooked.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:07.810
O-Oh...

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:09.580
You need to dress properly.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:12.620
<i>Yena's rigorous Hitomification training</i>

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:15.290
<i>involved the cooperation 
of the whole cooking club.</i>

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:19.770
<i>Over time, Yena began to 
develop a female mentality,</i>

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:21.600
<i>and her behavior and attitude</i>

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:25.350
<i>gradually became more and more feminine.</i>

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:34.860
Yena, you seem really different now 
than when you came home last time.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.770
Well, that's because

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.930
a girl I'm friends with at school has been—

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:39.860
A friend...

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:40.610
...who's a girl?!

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:43.510
She's teaching me how to act like a female.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.580
Is it... weird?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.830
It's great! Absolutely great!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.290
Oh, good.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.930
Great! Absolutely great!

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:52.370
Great! Absolutely great!

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:53.370
Yummy!

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:56.740
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:57.990
<i>Brown bear!</i>

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:02.030
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:04.050
<i>Honey badger!</i>

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:22.410
Wow!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.580
You're sort of looking the part now.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.060
You look cute, Yena!

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.160
Thanks.

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:30.460
Yena-chan!

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:33.950
You did it! You're every bit a girl now!

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:36.710
Thanks to you, Hitomi!

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.970
It didn't even look like you 
were biting into a bone!

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:43.220
I just love the cerebrospinal 
fluid in them.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.490
I know! Let's all go pick flowers together!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.500
I'd rather pick eucalyptus!

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.720
Let's go with bamboo!

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:53.230
<i>It's like she's turned into something 
else that's not like Hitomi-chan.</i>

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:57.190
But... first...

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:02.700
<i>Hyenas can eat bones by biting through 
them with their powerful jaws.</i>

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:08.200
<i>But although they eat bones, they can 
only digest the organic components.</i>

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:11.370
<i>The hard fragments that make up 
the rest, like bones and claws...</i>

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.040
<i>are regurgitated as a pellet.</i>

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.170
Are you even trying, damn it?!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.970
What girl vomits up undigested food?!

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:25.260
It's biological! I can't help it!

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.340
Damn it!

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:31.600
Does this mean I can never be 
the kind of female Hitomi is?

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:34.310
Yena-chan...

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.450
Damn it...

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:37.830
Damn it!

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:42.220
Can't you just be a tomboy?

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.990
Meimei-chan, what do you mean?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:49.700
Well, pandas are carnivores 
that seem like herbivores.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.470
Pandas are... carnivores?

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:55.620
That's right. We just eat 
bamboo because we like to.

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:59.290
<i>Although pandas are carnivores, 
over the course of evolution,</i>

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:04.010
<i>eating tons of bamboo made them 
lose their taste for meat.</i>

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.390
What's wrong with living the way you like? Meh!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:07.390
<b>Meh★</b>

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.490
I-I...

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.490
Oh! I found you, Ranka-san!

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:14.520
She's back!

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.470
This time, I'm gonna fight—

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:21.980
Why's a hyena dude in a skirt getting 
all buddy-buddy with these punks?

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:25.420
I guess it's true that you 
turned into a female.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:29.260
So are you copying these weak humans 
to try to seem more feminine?

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.330
You guys...

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:34.660
Whoa, there. Make any funny moves, 
and there's no telling what'll happen to her.

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:38.420
You guys aren't acting like males.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.550
It's because I'm a male that I can 
do this without thinking twice!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.030
It's called survival of the fittest!

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:46.470
Why don't you get it over with, then?

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:47.680
Jin?!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:47.680
Jin-kun?

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:47.680
Jin-san?

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.560
We cooking club members don't 
stand a chance against lions.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:55.140
So do it. Be a male.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:57.990
Fine! I will!

00:13:58.620 --> 00:13:59.460
Huh?

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.660
This is bad! We have to do something!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.400
She'll be killed!

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:07.640
Stop...

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.910
Stop! She'll die!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.240
Like a male...

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.000
Jin! Do something!

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:15.130
You brutes!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.910
<i>She's actually fine, though.</i>

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:20.980
<i>The honey badger's weapon is the 
protection given by its thick pelt.</i>

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.040
<i>Its pelt is so tough and</i>

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:26.880
<i>pliable that even the fangs of lions 
and hyenas can't penetrate it.</i>

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.800
Hurr...

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:33.010
<i>Sparkle, sparkle!</i>

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:35.680
This little...

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:41.020
It looks like I was so focused on 
little details that I lost sight of myself.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.110
Yena-chan?

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.100
What the hell?

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:47.240
Weren't you gonna start acting like a female?!

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:50.360
<i>Boxers?!</i>

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.420
I am...

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.710
a male!

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.750
<b>I am</b>

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:56.750
<b>a male!!</b>

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:00.990
This is definitely who I am!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:02.750
<b>Y
e
n
a</b>

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.750
<b>R
e
t
u
r
n
s
!!</b>

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:04.910
Where'd that little runt go?

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:07.340
If she's picking fights with Ranka-sama again—

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:13.390
Ranka-san! Please fight me!

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:16.990
That beating they gave her 
didn't affect her at all?

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.540
Well, she's a honey badger.

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:21.190
Ranka-san! Please fight me!

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.900
Give me a break, will you?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:25.730
There's no reason for us to fight.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:26.530
Yes, there is!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:27.790
I don't want to!

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:28.700
I have to defeat you and...

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:29.530
I said no!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.490
Please!

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.540
No! No!

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:34.520
Fight me! Fight me! Fight me!

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:34.520
No! No! No! No! No! No! No!

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:35.740
Hold up.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.450
If you can beat me, I'll let you fight Ranka.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:39.570
Yena?!

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:41.930
I believe in repaying favors right away.

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:42.710
Besides...

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:45.510
You seem pretty strong.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:46.540
<b>Her Fighter's Brain Is Also Back</b>

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:50.550
Okay! I'll beat you, and then
 challenge Ranka-san!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.140
Bring it on!

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.820
I will be a wolf!

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:55.010
What does that mean?

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:56.580
Here I come!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.070
That reeks!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:10.010
<i>Honey badgers store an intensely stinky fluid</i>

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:12.350
<i>in the scent glands near their tails,</i>

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:14.450
<i>which they can spray at will.</i>

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:29.050
I did it! I defeated Ranka-san!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.700
Wait! It's not fair to say you won that way!

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:33.290
Our fight isn't over—

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:37.350
Oh, boss! I won!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:45.770
What did you just do to my little sister?!

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:54.930
Ranka!

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.710
Are you okay, Ranka?

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:01.140
Ouch, ouch, ouch...

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:02.740
Wait, it hurts?

00:17:02.740 --> 00:17:07.040
This is pain? But I didn't feel 
anything when the lions beat me up!

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:10.630
How cool! This is the first 
time I've felt pain!

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:09.380
<b>Ouch</b>

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:10.150
<b>Ouch</b>

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:10.630
<b>Ouch</b>

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:14.130
Ouch! This really hurts!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:14.130
Is she happy to be in pain? What a weirdo.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.670
Looks like I don't need to hold back with you.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.050
Onee-chan?

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:19.620
Ranka!

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:21.260
Ranka-san!

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:24.870
So you're the boss's little sister, Ranka-san!

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:26.760
You're so small, I couldn't tell!

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:29.420
Huh? Boss? You're talking
about Onee-chan's pack?

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:32.690
Yes! Thanks to you, I was 
able to join her pack!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:35.200
I did not let you join!

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:35.200
Ouchie!

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.760
Onee-chan let another animal in her pack?

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:40.450
That's great!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:43.070
I'm so happy, Onee-chan!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:43.070
Ouchie!

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.710
That's right!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.130
She's an important member of our pack.

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:51.320
That's awesome, Onee-chan!

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:52.970
Thank you, thank you...

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:55.430
You finally understand that you can 
be friends with other animals!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.220
Stupid... giant... wolf...

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:56.970
Really? You think I'm awesome?

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.410
Yeah! You're awesome, Onee-chan!

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:01.890
This is my precious packmate, the shrimp!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:02.960
Yena-chan?

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:04.500
Shrimp!

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.870
Imagine these on Yena.

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:13.730
I can't wait.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.900
Hey, Dad! Bro!

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.610
I'm back to being a male!

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:21.530
Just came to let ya know! Later!

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:28.370
Oh... She's going to be a male again.

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:32.750
And we got her these in secret 
thinking it would make her happy...

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.680
This was Yena's decision.

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:35.630
Besides...

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:37.610
Did you see that face?

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:40.060
Yena's always tended to run off without seeing

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:41.390
I'm a male!

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.100
anything when absorbed in something.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.680
That's what makes Yena who she is...

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.890
My son.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.110
Dad...

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:51.550
Still, let's hold on to this stuff.

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:53.040
For the future.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:54.060
Yeah.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:58.360
<b>Cafeteria</b>

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:00.290
Hitomi.

00:19:01.690 --> 00:19:02.620
Yena-chan!

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:05.440
Oh... Yena... kun?

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:06.740
Either's fine.

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.430
You look nice in that uniform, too.

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:12.420
Thanks. This one really feels more right to me.

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:16.550
You know, I never actually thanked you.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:20.800
Thanks, Hitomi. You helped me out a lot.

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.300
Yena-kun...

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.330
You really are a great female!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.590
Oh, please... I didn't do anything.

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:30.610
I know! You can have some of my food!

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:32.200
Here. Open wide.

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:33.310
Uh, that's—

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:33.990
Hey!

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:37.380
You're not gonna thank us, you stupid hyena?

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.810
Oh, you're here, too? I didn't notice.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.090
Thanks!

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:42.700
Here, Hitomi.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.970
Cut it out!

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:46.840
That's getting way too cozy!

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:49.600
What? You wanna fight me for Hitomi?

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:52.050
Bring it on, beast! I'll murder you!

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:53.200
Be nice, okay?

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:55.240
You don't even understand 
how girls think.

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:55.710
You look good in that.

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:55.710
Shut up!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.210
Yay! Yay!

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:01.620
Now, listen. Now that you're part 
of our pack, you'll start as a—

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:02.250
Ooh! Whee!

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:03.090
Hey! Listen to me!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.640
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:30.640
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:21:36.550 --> 00:21:39.860
A herbivore and a carnivore can 
never understand each other.

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:43.460
Don't worry. I'll protect you.

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:44.860
Captain...

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.850
But I...

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:48.110
Yo, yo, yo!

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:50.560
Show off in front of us, will ya?

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:52.120
Damn normies!

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:54.120
Captain?!

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:57.490
Looks like you just got dumped, cutie!

00:21:57.490 --> 00:21:58.880
Eek!

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:08.940
Kin-kun! Why...

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:11.350
After what I did to you...

00:22:12.210 --> 00:22:14.130
You might find it pathetic,

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:18.570
but I cannot forget you, nor can 
I bear a grudge against you.

00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:22.190
It matters not if I can never be your king,

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:25.030
or even if I cannot be near you.

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:30.030
But please allow me to at least 
be the knight who protects you.

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:35.330
I'm sorry, Kin-kun!

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:39.260
I was lying when I said I 
wanted to focus on track!

00:22:39.260 --> 00:22:40.710
The truth is that I was scared!

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:44.890
I was scared by how much I 
was starting to like you!

00:22:44.890 --> 00:22:47.820
There's no way a lion and 
an impala could ever...

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:53.060
For you, I would forsake my identity as a lion.

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:58.560
Let us eat grass, run upon the fields, 
and live our lives together...

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:00.230
As impalas.

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:01.600
Kin-kun...

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:02.690
Shiho-dono...

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.100
Kin-kun...

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:05.360
Shiho-dono...

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:07.590
Shiho-dono... Shiho-dono...

00:23:05.870 --> 00:23:09.990
K-Kin-kun? Wait... No!

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:12.770
Stop!

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:17.220
I'm not in heat right now!

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.570
Kin-kun, you jerk!

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:26.500
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:27.550
<b>Yena here.</b>

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:29.300
<b>Even if I'm a female, I'm still a male.</b>

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:30.360
<b>Ferrill here.</b>

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:31.570
<b>I still love Ranka like crazy.</b>

00:23:31.570 --> 00:23:32.450
<b>It seems all the students are going to the beach next time.</b>

00:23:32.450 --> 00:23:33.260
<b>What!?</b>

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:34.780
<b>Won't Ranka be lonely without me!?</b>

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:36.120
<b>Don't worry. She'll have her friends,</b>

00:23:36.120 --> 00:23:36.990
<b>and besides, you're just gonna butt in anyway, aren't you?</b>

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:38.770
<b>Well, I'll miss her! Rankaaaaaaa!!!!</b>

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 8</b>

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>The Beach Bard</b>
